sequenceDiagram
    participant Student
    participant Browser
    participant ProfileController
    participant ReportGradeController
    participant DocumentController
    participant SpecializationController
    participant Database
    participant Storage

    Note over Student,Storage: Student Registration Flow (PPDB)

    %% Step 1: Personal Data
    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
        Note right of Student: Step 1: Input Personal Data
        Student->>Browser: Access /student/profile
        Browser->>ProfileController: GET profile.index
        ProfileController->>Database: Get student data
        Database-->>ProfileController: Student data (if exists)
        ProfileController-->>Browser: Show profile form
        Student->>Browser: Fill personal data
        Browser->>ProfileController: POST/PUT profile
        ProfileController->>ProfileController: Validate data
        ProfileController->>Database: Save student data
        Database-->>ProfileController: Data saved
        ProfileController-->>Browser: Success message
        Browser-->>Student: Show success & progress (25%)
    end

    %% Step 2: Report Grades
    rect rgb(255, 220, 200)
        Note right of Student: Step 2: Input Report Grades
        Student->>Browser: Access /student/report-grades
        Browser->>ReportGradeController: GET report-grades.index
        ReportGradeController->>Database: Get report grades
        Database-->>ReportGradeController: Report grades data
        ReportGradeController-->>Browser: Show grades form
        Student->>Browser: Input grades (PAI, B.Indo, B.Inggris)
        Browser->>ReportGradeController: POST report-grades
        ReportGradeController->>ReportGradeController: Validate grades
        ReportGradeController->>Database: Save grades
        Database-->>ReportGradeController: Grades saved
        ReportGradeController-->>Browser: Success message
        Browser-->>Student: Show success & progress (50%)
    end

    %% Step 3: Upload Documents
    rect rgb(220, 255, 200)
        Note right of Student: Step 3: Upload Documents
        Student->>Browser: Access /student/documents
        Browser->>DocumentController: GET documents.index
        DocumentController->>Database: Get uploaded documents
        Database-->>DocumentController: Documents list
        DocumentController-->>Browser: Show documents page
        Student->>Browser: Upload document (KTP, Ijazah, etc)
        Browser->>DocumentController: POST documents
        DocumentController->>DocumentController: Validate file
        DocumentController->>Storage: Save file
        Storage-->>DocumentController: File path
        DocumentController->>Database: Save document record
        Database-->>DocumentController: Document saved
        DocumentController-->>Browser: Success message
        Browser-->>Student: Show success & progress (75%)
    end

    %% Step 4: Choose Specialization
    rect rgb(255, 255, 200)
        Note right of Student: Step 4: Choose Specialization
        Student->>Browser: Access /student/specialization
        Browser->>SpecializationController: GET specialization.index
        SpecializationController->>Database: Get specialization data
        Database-->>SpecializationController: Current specialization
        SpecializationController-->>Browser: Show specialization form
        Student->>Browser: Choose specialization (Tahfiz/Language)
        Browser->>SpecializationController: POST specialization
        SpecializationController->>SpecializationController: Validate choice
        SpecializationController->>Database: Save specialization
        Database-->>SpecializationController: Specialization saved
        SpecializationController-->>Browser: Success message
        Browser-->>Student: Show success & progress (100%)
    end

    Note over Student,Storage: Registration Complete - Waiting for Validation
